  "bug_discussion": "Official GH-16955 reports a supported libcurl HTTP/2 multiplexed download that hangs after its 10,485,760-byte stream receive window is consumed while the application repeatedly pauses/unpauses under backpressure. Public reporter C++/Caddy evidence and fixing PR are archived. A source-exact host replay with nghttp2 1.64.0 and the functional February 2025 introduction shows parent/buggy/repaired slow application progress of 16,777,216/10,485,760/16,777,216 bytes under identical remote response bytes; the buggy stream has zero peer window and no later WINDOW_UPDATE. Independent security review and normal Docker verification remain pending.",
